<%# The task of a writing item (D-407, D-410), drawn the same on the topic page's «Scrivi tu» and in the item's shot: the task text, then the advice on how to write it
    (the item's answer_format, a plain line as the practice page draws it), then the word range. A bilingual item has the target language with its Italian behind the
    translation toggle; the text is drawn with the items' markup (a blank line makes a paragraph, a numbered list needs a blank line before it), by the page's markup
    controller (data-markup). Locals: prompt (Writings::Prompt), id (the prefix of the task's element ids). %>
<div class="writing-stem" id="<%= id %>-stem" <%= tag.attributes(lang: prompt.lang) if prompt.lang %> data-markup="block"><%= prompt.stem %></div>
<%= tr_node(prompt.stem_tr, tag: :div, markup: "inline") if prompt.stem_tr %>
<% if prompt.format %>
  <p class="answer-format" id="<%= id %>-format" <%= tag.attributes(lang: prompt.format_lang) if prompt.format_lang %> data-markup="inline"><%= prompt.format %></p>
  <%= tr_node(prompt.format_tr, tag: :div, markup: "inline") if prompt.format_tr %>
<% end %>
<p class="writing-range"><%= t("writing.words", min: prompt.words_min, max: prompt.words_max) %></p>
